<Layout title="What to Do If You Inherit a House With a Reverse Mortgage in Texas" description="Inheriting a home with a reverse mortgage comes with a tight timeline and decisions that need to be made quickly. Here's what you need to know and what your options are.">

  <section class="page-hero navy-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/blog" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Blog</a>
